\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 Phase 1 MVP: Google Play App Scout\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Goal\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Build a simple Python application that uses a local Ollama model to autonomously search Google Play for potentially interesting niche apps.\
The application should:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pick a niche to explore.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Search Google Play for apps in that niche.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Progress through search results instead of repeatedly examining the same top apps.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Save discovered apps to a local SQLite database.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Remember which apps have already been seen.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Remember which searches/niches have already been explored.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Use a local Ollama model to decide whether an app looks potentially interesting by feeding it the app's available basic information and metadata.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Save only potentially interesting apps as opportunities.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Run repeatedly without constantly doing the same work.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 There is 
\f1\b no frontend
\f0\b0 .\
The SQLite database is the output.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

