Example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
2026-09-06 14:30:00\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 This helps prevent the system from repeatedly selecting the same niche.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
